#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "畸变怪 - 手速神明"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid ""
"以 [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 和 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] "
"为核心，利用海盗实现无限循环。[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] 和 [[Brann "
"Bronzebeard||96786]] 能帮助你在前期消耗铸币，让经济开始滚雪球。然后，使用 [[The Shadow of "
"Doubt||131716]] 强化你的神明。实现无限循环后，购买遇到的每一张 [[Greedy Conniver||134421]]，并使用 "
"[[Eyes of the Earth Mother||100601]] 或 [[Elite Navigator||119986]] "
"将其变为金色，以便发现 [[Sha of Fear||131720]]。确保每回合结束时场上始终有3个畸变怪。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid ""
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + [[The Shadow "
"of Doubt||131716]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid ""
"[[The Shadow of Doubt||131716]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/96/
msgid "Play cards to scale deity."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "海盗 - 金色手速"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid ""
"利用 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]、[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 和 [[Proud"
" Privateer||122520]] 的组合实现无限经济，[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] "
"可以帮助这套体系顺利启动。有了上进的逃兵后，你会打出大量金色随从并触发许多发现效果，这两者都能很好地配合 [[Hooktusk, Master "
"Marauder||132925]]。利用无限经济购买带有发现效果的卡牌，不断提升阵容强度。进阶玩家：转型为上限更高的恶魔酒馆强化流。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] + 无限铸币"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/89/
msgid "Use infinite money to scale pirates"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "机械 - 手速磁力"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid ""
"首先要建立近乎无限的金币循环。[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]、[[Proud Privateer||122520]]、[[Enterprising Escapee||132762]]和[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]都能帮助你做到这一点。建立循环后，反复买卖[[Sellemental||64038]]等低费用随从。\n"
"接着用[[Auto Reveille||134417]]生成磁力随从，并提升[[Spark Snapper||132676]]的属性，让之后吸附的磁力随从迅速变强。拿到[[Spark Snapper||132676]]后，在场上留一个金色[[Drone Duplicator||132312]]，不断向它吸附磁力随从，养出一个属性极高的磁力随从。用[[Auto Reveille||134417]]将其轻松合成金色，再把这个巨大的金色磁力随从吸附到已触发效果的[[Drone Duplicator||132312]]上。\n"
"最后，买下所有遇到的[[Greedy Conniver||134421]]，并对它们使用大地母亲之眼，以获得[[Polarizing Beatboxer||98713]]。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid ""
"无限铸币 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]]) + [[Auto"
" Reveille||134417]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "无限铸币 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/99/
msgid "Attach bigger and bigger magnetics"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "野猪人 - 手速商店强化"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid ""
"要玩此流派，你必须拥有极强的经济能力。通常可以在第 9 回合靠 铜须+ 罗杰斯+ 私掠者 "
"建立经济优势。你也可以通过反复买卖能强化宝石和提高法术强度的随从来提升酒馆中的随从，并购买[[Veteran "
"Brigand||132929]]等所有能大量提供宝石的卡牌。经济运转起来后，你还会获得大量法术，让[[Felboar||110664]]或[[Twisted"
" Wrathguard||130662]]反复吞噬属性极高的酒馆随从。最适合反复买卖的是[[Fearless "
"Foodie||113154]]等能生成鲜血宝石的随从。将指定目标的法术施放到[[Gatekeeper "
"Amalgam||133329]]或[[Devilish Distractor||132901]]身上，也能有效利用这些法术。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "早期无限铸币 + 邪能野猪人"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/76/
msgid "Cast spells to consume buffed shop."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "亡灵 - 手速"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid ""
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] 与 [[Proud Privateer||122520]] "
"的组合可以提供大量铸币，帮助你找到更多阵容组件。其他可以帮助你实现无限循环的卡牌包括 [[Enterprising Escapee||132762]] "
"和 [[Brann "
"Bronzebeard||96786]]，但当你确定在场上投入更多亡灵后，可以将它们替换掉。循环使用所有免费卡牌（[[Refreshing "
"Anomaly||64042]]），以维持无限循环。实现无限循环后，利用悬赏令和 [[Forsaken Weaver||126733]] "
"提高亡灵的攻击力。使用一张金色且具有复生的 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] 来保证阵容强度。此外，使用 [[Snazzy "
"Phantom||133083]]，并循环使用 [[Maw Caster||121508]] 和 [[Disguised "
"Graverobber||104610]] 等所有能够消灭亡灵的效果，消灭具有复生的亡灵，让时尚魅影永久获得属性。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid ""
"悬赏令生成器 ([[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]) + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] + "
"[[Forsaken Weaver||126733]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/3/
msgid "Scale undead attack with infinite gold"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "亡灵 - 攻击提升"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"使用 [[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]] 生成的“宰割”法术，提高亡灵及其召唤物的攻击力。[[Friendly "
"Geist||120219]] 提供的法术成长可以进一步强化“宰割”，而 [[Handless Forsaken||95265]] "
"则负责提供优质召唤物。[[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 能在战斗阶段和酒馆阶段为最右边的随从提供大量攻击力和生命值。场上有 "
"[[Snazzy Phantom||133083]] 时，开始对具有复生的随从使用“宰割”，从而获得永久属性。这套阵容最强的变体是使用 [[Dead "
"Bellringer||132322]] 和 "
"[[Mummifier||108992]]，先让整个场面都获得复生。随后，在手中存满“宰割”且场上拥有时尚魅影时，让丧钟死灵对木乃伊工匠发动效果。木乃伊工匠被消灭后，丧钟死灵会获得复生。接着对丧钟死灵使用“宰割，并用手中所有“宰割”重复这一过程，从而大量触发时尚魅影。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"攻击成长 ([[Drustfallen Butcher||120104]]) + 亡灵召唤([[Handless Forsaken||95265]])"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid ""
"[[Deathly Striker||115610]] \n"
"亡灵中期过度 ([[Plaguerunner||126451]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/14/
msgid "Summon high attack Undeads"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "龙 - 战吼"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + [[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] "
"能让你的所有龙在你每使用一张战吼牌后获得+4/+4。你需要触发尽可能多的战吼。阵容成型后，只循环使用优质战吼牌，例如 [[Tavern "
"Tempest||64077]]、[[Refreshing Anomaly||64042]]、[[Shell Collector||80740]] 或 "
"[[Draconic Warden||126860]]。如果本局游戏中有 [[Kelp "
"Keeper||132883]]，就将其留在场上，每回合触发一个优质战吼，最好是 [[Draconic "
"Warden||126860]]。这套阵容的最高上限是每回合尽可能多地寻找使攻击力翻倍的法术，并借助 [[Persistent "
"Poet||108463]]，每回合永久翻倍英勇的巢母的攻击力。此外，还可以使用 [[Nadina, The Red||60629]] "
"永久为你的龙附加圣盾。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "[[Kalecgos, Arcane Aspect||60630]] + [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/15/
msgid "Cycle battlecries to scale dragons"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "野兽 - 甲虫"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid ""
"前期获得 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]] "
"后，开始提高甲虫的属性。[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]] 可以配合 [[Snarky "
"Shark||132804]]，帮助你生成阵容所需的组件。尽可能多地使用 [[Banana "
"Slamma||98824]]，它们可以使甲虫的攻击力翻倍，帮助你应对高生命值阵容。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "早期 [[Ravaging Scorpid||132949]] 或 [[Turquoise Skitterer||119255]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/38/
msgid "Summon large beetles"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "野猪人 - 抉择"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid ""
"首先要提升鲜血宝石的效果，最常见的方法是使用[[Gem rat||116434]]，也可以使用[[Sanguine "
"Refiner||122566]]。[[Turbo Hogrider||116195]]是宝石成长后的核心收益点。最好通过[[Gem "
"Rat||116434]]或[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]获取一些“抉择”效果。如果本局有龙，可以用[[Sky-hatch "
"Runaway||132957]]触发[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]]，大量获取“抉择”效果。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid ""
"[[Gem rat||116434]]/[[Bramble Tunneler||132632]] + [[Turbo "
"Hogrider||116195]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "宝石成长 ([[Gem Rat||116434]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/88/
msgid "Play Choose One cards to scale"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "龙 - 希望信使"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid ""
"Find an early [[Hopebringer||134411]] (latest turn 8) and start scaling its "
"effect. Use [[Persistent Poet||108463]] to keep the stats given by "
"Hopebringer. The best dragon to buff is [[Heroic Broodmother||134494]], who "
"additionally scales the Hopebringer a bunch. [[Nadina the Red||60629]] gives"
" permanent shield to your Hopebringer and also increases your Hopebringer "
"scaling a bit. [[Crimson Vindicator||132953]] can be used for stabilization."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "早期获得 [[Hopebringer||134411]] +圣盾"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "圣盾([[Bronze Warden||60558]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/101/
msgid "Proc Divine Shields to scale"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "恶魔 - 亡语/商店强化"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid ""
"尽早拿到[[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]]（最晚第 6 回合），再确定玩这个流派，并每回合触发其效果。用[[Titus"
" Rivendare||97408]]使效果触发两次，大幅提升酒馆中随从的属性。[[Imp-lusionist||132899]]与[[Balinda "
"Stonehearth||130298]]是这套阵容的核心收益点，能吞噬大量酒馆随从。[[Soulkeeping "
"Jailer||132306]]也是帮助你稳住局面的优秀恶魔。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "早期获得 [[Sacrificial Wrathguard||134405]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "牺牲的愤怒卫士"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/100/
msgid "Scale and eat the shop with deathrattles."
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "畸变怪 - 亡语/法术"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid ""
"神明是克苏恩时强得多！使用 [[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]] "
"强化你的神明。生成法术来强化无面转化者，最好的方式是使用 [[Unwilling Slacker||131700]]，不过 [[N'raqi "
"Sapper||131704]]、[[Nightmare Corroder||133102]] "
"或手速悬赏令体系也可以。然后尽可能多次触发亡语，通常需要使用 "
"[[Deathstrider||132808]]。最佳策略是使用野兽进击（[[Headhunter Gryphon||132800]]），并循环使用 "
"[[Snarky Shark||132804]] 和 [[Lurking Lionfish||132794]]，在酒馆招募阶段触发你的亡语。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid ""
"[[Faceless Converter||132331]] + [[Titus Rivendare||97408]]\n"
"[[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + [[Proud Privateer||122520]] 阵容上限最高"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "法术生成 ([[Unwilling Slacker||131700]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/94/
msgid "Play spells and proc deathrattle to scale Deity"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/104/
msgid "Undead - Eternal Knight"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/104/
msgid ""
"Must have an [[Eternal Knight||95261]] early on to start scaling it (turn 4 "
"latest). Then, fill out the rest of your board with [[Eternal "
"Summoner||95263]] and [[Eternal Tycoon||129263]]. If you find [[Snazzy "
"Phantom||133083]] + [[Dead Bellringer||132322]], use Bellringer's activate "
"on your [[Eternal Knight||95261]] every turn to scale."
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/104/
msgid "Early [[Eternal Knight||95261]] + [[Eternal Summoner||95263]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/104/
msgid "Early [[Eternal Knight||95261]]"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/104/
msgid "Summon many Eternal Knights"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "野猪人 - 手牌宝石"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid ""
"首先，你需要用[[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]提升宝石效果，才能玩这个流派。之后主要依靠[[Victorious "
"Geomant||134423]]将宝石加入手牌，再用[[Hot-Air Surveyor||113152]]施放宝石。优先将宝石用于[[Blade "
"Collector||99035]]等功能性随从。到了后期，完成属性集中后，用[[Leeroy the "
"Reckless||90425]]等终局随从填满剩余的场上位置"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "宝石成长 ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]]) + [[Hot Air Surveyor||113152]]"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "宝石成长 ([[Sanguine Refiner||122566]])"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/63/
msgid "Add buffed gems to hand"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "鱼人 - 关键词"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid ""
"尽早使用下水道逃生鱼人，给一只优质鱼人添加额外关键词。首选[[Expert Aviator||126637]]，其次是[[Bile "
"Spitter||122219]]。然后用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 循环使用[[Primalfin "
"Lookout||60028]]和黑客鱼人。如果还能用[[Kelp Keeper||132883]]反复触发优质战吼，效果会更好。使用[[Expert "
"Aviator||126637]]时，尽量从手牌中大量召唤[[Leeroy, The Reckless||90425]]和[[Deadly "
"Spore||65031]]等针对型随从。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] + 下水道逃生鱼人"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid ""
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]]\n"
"下水道逃生鱼人"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/31/
msgid "Add Keywords to Murlocs and buff them"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "野兽 - 深潜巨兽"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid ""
"尽早获得 [[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] 后，尽可能多地召唤野兽。最好的野兽召唤组件是获得了复生的 [[Sewer "
"lord||130996]]。其次是囤食土狼，它可以召唤一个具有嘲讽的随从。搭配 [[Banana Slamma||98824]] "
"后，每个召唤出来的随从都能获得大量攻击力。"
msgstr ""

#: when_to_commit | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "早期获得[[Lurking Leviathan||130711]] + 野兽召唤([[Sewer Lord||130996]])"
msgstr ""

#: common_enablers | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "野兽召唤中期过度（甲虫）"
msgstr ""

#: summary | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/83/
msgid "Make huge attack summons"
msgstr ""

#: name | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid "元素 - 活化艾泽里特"
msgstr ""

#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/95/
msgid ""
"使用 [[Living Azerite||107939]] 强化酒馆。你可以利用 [[Sky Admiral Rogers||122516]] + "
"[[Proud Privateer||122520]] 施放大量法术。然后，酒馆强化的核心收益手段是生成尽可能多的奥术吸收，也就是 [[Leyline "
"Surfacer||130294]] 生成的法术。使用 [[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] 和 [[Kelp "
"Keeper||132883]] 生成奥术吸收，再用 [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]] "
"使其效果翻倍。最后，最适合接受强化的元素是 [[Wildfire Elemental||64189]]。"
msgstr ""

