msgid ""
"First scale spell power through Chromadrake generation, typically via "
"[[Bronze Timewalker||132955]] + [[Sky-Hatch Runaway||132957]]. Then, use "
"[[Brann Bronzebeard||96786]] to double the effect of your Chromadrakes. Use "
"[[Crimson Vindicator||132953]] as your payoff card, and then start proccing "
"the rally of it with [[Sky-Hatch Runaway||132957]]. Use [[Persistent "
"Poet||108463]] to capture the buffs in combat from Crimson Vindicator and "
