#: how_to_play | https://hsreplay.net/battlegrounds/comps/67/
msgid ""
"First, have a ton of economy, typically starting from golden [[Brann "
"Bronzebeard||96786]] or Brann + [[Magicfin Mycologist||122277]], remembering"
" premium economy spells such as Cloning Conch or Battlecry Discovery. Then, "
"your payoff card for all that economy is [[Shamanic Tidecaller||133026]]. "
"Paired with [[Balinda Stonehearth||130298]], play as many spells on the "
"tidecaller as possible, which could be bloodgems or [[Iron "
"Groundskeeper||103666]] spells. Scale premium murlocs in hand such as [[Bile"
" Spitter||122219]] and [[Expert Aviator||126637]] so you can summon them and"
" also [[Choral Mrrrglr||98948]] can capture all of the stats of the murlocs "
"in your hand."
